# HeArt v1 — invented by John Pierce Davis Jr., Inventor and CEO.
# Keep the build context small: never ship the local venv, caches,
# tests, or — most importantly — secrets. The Dockerfile copies api/,
# scripts/, and supabase/ into the production image, so anything that
# could land inside those directories must be excluded here.
# (T2 red-pen item 5: .env / *.pem / *.key were missing. Item 11: tests
# rode into the image. Both fixed here.)

.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.db
uploads/
**/uploads/
.git/
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
*.log

# Secrets — at the root AND at any depth, because `*.pem` alone only
# matches the build-context root. A .env (or a stray .pem/.key) placed
# inside api/ would otherwise be copied into the production image.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.key
# The template is safe to ship — it holds placeholders, not values.
!.env.example
**/!.env.example

# Tests ship nothing the app needs at runtime (T2 red-pen item 11).
api/tests/
**/tests/
